work can be in hard-copy or supplied digitally on USB.

If work is submitted digitally for moderation, it must be
in a suitable file format and structure. A list of approved
file formats and the structure for electronic evidence
is provided in Appendix A. Students must submit their
completed product(s) in an electronic format that is
suitable for the client in the set assignment.

The marking criteria must be used to mark each
student’s work. These specify the levels of skills,
knowledge and understanding that the student is
required to demonstrate.

•	 Where there is more than one strand within the

