the mark band most closely reflecting the standard
achieved across all strands within the band
descriptors for topic areas; however in this scenario,
the mark awarded for that band should reflect that
a strand has not been addressed.

When deciding the mark within a band, the criteria
below should be applied:

•

the extent to which the statements within the band
