7.4  Equality Act information relating to Cambridge Nationals

The Cambridge Nationals require assessment of a broad
range of skills and, as such, prepare students for further
study and higher-level courses.

The Cambridge Nationals qualifications were reviewed
to check if any of the competences required presented

a potential barrier to disabled students. If this was the
case, the situation was reviewed again to make sure
that such competences were included only where
essential to the subject.

